{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Church? yes, there's one down the road, little white one, steeple, the doors are open, people go there, to pray","Saint Anne's... or Calvary, or the Baptist one, I forget which, somebody's THERE, I saw a light","W-we pray together in the evenings... the few of us who are left, it helps, a little","I don't go... I'm not religious -- but I understand why you'd want to","There's a service every Sunday, even now, even if only three people come"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"The church is a gathering spot, a clearinghouse for news, a place to sit, a place to cry","Pastor's still there, still preaching, still burying, he's a strong man","Nuns at the convent take people in, feed them, pray for them, they're tough...","Thick walls and it's quiet, that's the best I can say for it","Churches are the first place they look, and the last place they give up on"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"You'd be welcome, there's always a pew, sit wherever you like"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Church? now? what for? God left","Find your own faith"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","role=rescue_clergy",{"Our doors are always open... come in, rest, pray, or just sit in the quiet..","We hold vespers at dusk, you're welcome to stay, there's always a seat"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","role=family_elder",{"Honey, I've been to church every Sunday for seventy years, and I'm not stopping now"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","role=family_man,family_woman",{"We pray at the table... every meal, even if it's just a cracker"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Church? There's one down the road, full of people praying, they made the mistake of locking the doors","I don't do church, preacher took my money once and told me it was God's will","Church is for people who still believe someone's listening","Sure, there's one, but if you go in I wouldn't turn my back on the pastor"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Church? You can pray all you like, nobody's answering!"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Honestly? I've been thinking about going, sit in the back, just to feel something","Yeah, there's a little chapel, they take in anyone, no questions, I stayed a night once, they fed me"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Church? My grandmother's church is still there, I think, the choir was singing last week","Preacher on the corner takes people in, he's good people, don't mess with him","Church's full of folks hiding, they got nowhere else to go"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Church? There's no church for you!"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I go sometimes, sit in the back pew, nobody bothers me"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Church? There's one on the hill, ringing the bell every evening, I like the sound","Not a churchgoing man, but I respect those who are, there's one past the quarry","Reverend at the little white one took in a dozen strays, fed 'em for a week"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Church? Not for the likes of you!"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=club|st=friendly",{"I'll walk you over, {g:brother|sister}, it's a good place"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Church, naturally, there's several in the county, all with congregations, all with secrets","Some pastors are more sympathetic than others"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I'd gladly escort you, if you'd like"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Church? Oh God, yes, I want to, I want to pray, but I'm scared I'll burn up when I walk in","I found Jesus inside, I want to find Him again out here"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Don't talk to me about church!"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"There's a small one, quiet, maybe we could sit together"}},
