{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"I'll take you, friend, I haven't been in years"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"The Methodist church is a designated shelter, ask for the pastor","A few churches are open as shelters, got volunteers and some supplies","Pastor Ellis runs a prayer group each evening, all are welcome","I can't confirm any church as a shelter"}},
