{"ASK_CHURCH","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"There's a congregation meeting somewhere on {street}, I let them be, they let me be"}},
{"ASK_CHURCH","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral|mood=grim",{"I've buried eleven people out of one church this month... so yes, there's a church"}},
