{"ASK_COLD_FEEL","",{"A little - you?","It's winter, cold comes with the territory","Cold enough that I notice, not enough that I stop","Cold? Can't tell anymore, everything's the same temperature now","Cold's cold - ask me again when it's worse"}},
{"ASK_COLD_FEEL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Why, do I look it?","Enough that I'm counting how many blankets are left"}},
