{"ASK_COLD_FEEL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Always, I haven't been warm since the Event"}},
{"ASK_COLD_FEEL","role=rescue_clergy",{"Cold's nothing - ask me about Sunday school in a drafty church"}},
{"ASK_COLD_FEEL","reg=law,swat",{"Cold enough that I'll put on every layer I have"}},
{"ASK_COLD_FEEL","reg=law,swat|tmp=seasoned",{"It's part of the job, doesn't mean I like it"}},
{"ASK_COLD_FEEL","reg=military,elite",{"Freezing, yeah, but I'm still going out there"}},
{"ASK_COLD_FEEL","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Cold's no big deal, I just keep moving and keep my socks dry"}},
