{"ASK_CORPSES","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Burn them? I don't know, I don't want to think about it, I can't, I just can't","We put them in the ground, the ones we could, with a prayer, with a flower, with a name","Leave them, don't touch them, don't LOOK at them, just walk away","Bury them, deep, with a stone on top, because I can't stand the thought of them coming back","I don't know what's right, I don't know what's wrong, I just know the smell is unbearable","My neighbor, I covered him with a sheet, and I said a prayer, and I left, I left him"}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Burn or bury, doesn't matter, so long as the head is done, so they can't get up","Dispose of them downwind, away from camp, away from water, away from where the kids play","Piles are bad, scatter them, and take the heads, and burn the heads","Don't leave a body whole, unless you're sure it's dead, and sure it stays dead","I'd rather not sleep beside a pile of bodies. Moving them is another risk, so think it through first"}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Don't really like talking about it... we move them when we can"}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Not my business, and not yours","Find a shovel, and a strong stomach","Don't touch that one, I don't know what killed it, and I don't know you - move away","Why are you so interested in bodies? Back up"}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","role=rescue_clergy",{"Every body deserves a prayer... and a place, even now, especially now..."}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","role=rescue_medical",{"Handle with gloves, wash with bleach, burn what you can, bury the rest deep.."}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Fire's the cleanest way, but fire draws attention, so we dig, and we dig deep"}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","role=militia",{"Biohazard, so each one gets logged, tagged and sealed before it goes in the ground"}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Bodies? I search 'em, take what's useful, and leave the rest for the flies","Leave 'em where they fall, they're not my problem, bury them if you've got time to waste","Burn 'em, if you've got fuel, otherwise just stay away","Stab 'em in the head first, then walk away, make sure they don't get up","Most of 'em are already gone, the ones that aren't, you finish"}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"You wanna see what I do with bodies? Stay here and find out!"}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"I bury them, if I can, it feels right, even though it's pointless","Honestly, I say a few words over them, just in case"}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Bodies attract the dead, so you burn 'em or you bury 'em","Pile 'em somewhere far away, downwind, don't ask me why","We cover 'em with a sheet and say a prayer"}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Corpses? I'll make you one!"}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Man, I had to bury my cousin, I still can't talk about it"}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"We give our dead a proper send-off, a fire, a few words, a bottle","Leave 'em alone, {g:brother|sister}, they've earned their rest, unless they get back up","Shoot 'em in the head before they rise, that's the kindest thing"}},
