{"ASK_CORPSES","reg=club|st=friendly",{"We bury ours with their colors, always"}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Disposal is a matter of discretion, and I have standards","Fire is the cleanest option, though conspicuous"}},
{"ASK_CORPSES","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I make arrangements, it's the least I can do"}},
