{"ASK_CORPSES","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"We couldn't bury Mrs. Bell, ground's too hard in this heat, we put a sheet over her in the garage - is that okay?","I don't touch them, I don't look at them, I go the long way around - I know that's no answer - I'm sorry","Somebody ought to say something over them - nobody does, I said the Lord's Prayer over a man on Elm yesterday"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
