{"ASK_CURE","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral",{"No cure, don't believe anyone who tells you otherwise"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"None"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral",{"Research continues, that's all I'm permitted to say","Negative on a cure, if you're bit, find somewhere quiet and don't make somebody else handle it"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"There isn't"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly,neutral",{"The cure is a bullet"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=raider|st=friendly,neutral",{"If there's a cure, it'd be worth a fortune - know where one is?"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral",{"Cure? You're dreaming, {g:man|lady}"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral",{"A cure for what? Life?"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"If a cure exists, it'll be sold, let's be realistic"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Heard there's one, heard that for years about everything"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"A cure? Oh, honey, I wish, I really, really wish, nobody has one, not that I've heard","There's a rumor, there's always a rumor, a vaccine, a pill, a shot, I heard the Army's got one, but they're keeping it","If there was a cure, don't you think I'd be using it? don't you think my husband would be here?","Pray, I guess, that's the only medicine I've got left","There's no cure, there's just the bite and the fever and then... then the end","I asked a doctor at the clinic -- she cried, that's ALL the answer I need","I keep thinking, if only I'd had a cure, I'd have saved my little girl, I- I can't","The TV said \"researchers are working on it,\" but TV also said \"stay calm,\" so, not much faith!!","There's no cure... there's only running, and hiding, and not getting bit"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"No cure, nobody's got one, don't let anybody sell you one, there's snake-oil men out here","Folks swear by boiled garlic... vinegar, whiskey, none of it works, I tried, I tried them all on a friend","If it exists, it's in a lab somewhere, behind a fence, behind a gun","You get bit, you're done... sooner you quit hoping, the less it hurts","I've seen too many people try, I've seen what they drink, what they cut, what they pray for, it doesn't work","Cure is a nice word, it belongs to a different world"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"The government said they're working on a treatment, a treatment, not a cure, but still, it's hope, right?","They said it's treatable if you catch it early, but how do you catch it early? it's in the bite!"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Don't ask me about cures, I'll bite your head off","If I knew of one, I wouldn't tell you","Cure? Ha! you really are naive","There's no cure, so leave it alone!!","Cure? Ha","There isn't one","Don't ask me","You're dreaming","Why? You looking for one? Let's see your arms before you take another step","Folks who ask about cures usually need one - stay right there"},false,{[9]="SHOW_ARMS"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=rescue_medical",{"There is no cure, and I won't lie to you, antibiotics don't touch it, nor does anything else I carry","I tried everything in the cabinet, every dose, every mix... same result every time","I can slow the fever, I can ease the pain, I can't stop the end, I'm sorry, that's the truth","If someone tells you they've found a vaccine, ask to see the paperwork, then run"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=rescue_clergy",{"Only faith offers cure now... and even faith can't undo the bite, it can only help us bear it","I have seen miracles, but not this kind, not yet"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=militia",{"Last I heard, nothing - some scientists in a tent with test tubes and a mountain of paperwork","If there was a cure... the Army would've announced it, with a parade, so no"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=civilian_loner",{"Folk remedies are for colds... not this, anything that cures this is a story...","I've watched a man drink bleach to cure it, don't be that man"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"I've tried everything in my cabinet, and a few things from other cabinets, and nothing","There's no cure, only comfort, and comfort I can do, if you ask, if you stay","If anyone says they have a cure, ask them to take it themselves, in front of you","Antibiotics don't work, antivirals don't work, steroids don't work, prayer sometimes helps the family"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"Cure? Not from me -- not today, not for you"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"A cure? There was a man at the clinic who swore he had one","They say there's a lab somewhere, with a vial","I've seen people try everything","I asked a doctor","If there were one -- don't you think we'd have heard?","Everybody wants to believe","A cure for what... exactly?","There's no cure","My neighbor's convinced garlic works","I read about a vaccine in the paper","Maybe someday"},false,false,{[1]={{t="he took it himself",afterMs=3500},{t="we buried him Thursday",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="I say, if there is, it's behind a locked door",afterMs=3200},{t="and a bigger gun",afterMs=3000}},[3]={{t="bleach, whiskey, prayer",afterMs=3500},{t="nothing works, nothing at all",afterMs=3000}},[4]={{t="she cried",afterMs=3200},{t="that was my answer",afterMs=2800}},[5]={{t="somebody would have said something",afterMs=3500},{t="someone would be waving a flag",afterMs=3000}},[6]={{t="including me",afterMs=3200}},[7]={{t="the bite, or the world?",afterMs=3500},{t="neither one's in stock",afterMs=3000}},[8]={{t="there's only time, and company",afterMs=3500}},[9]={{t="she's still alive",afterMs=3200},{t="but so is her garlic, so who knows",afterMs=2800}},[10]={{t="last month",afterMs=3500},{t="it was for a different thing, I think",afterMs=3000}},[11]={{t="not for us",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"The cure is a ham sandwich and a long nap","A cure? Sure, it's called \"don't get bitten\"","My cure is a nap and a cup of coffee"},false,false,{[1]={{t="it won't fix this, but it fixes me",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="works for everything but this",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"I wish I had better news"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I truly do",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"There'll be a cure, there has to be, scientists work miracles","They said on the radio they're testing something"},false,false,{[2]={{t="I'm clinging to that",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,14",{"No cure yet, and I've stopped reading the rumors","They keep saying \"soon\""},false,false,{[2]={{t="soon is a long word",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=15,99999",{"There's no cure... and there won't be one in time","I've stopped waiting for a miracle"},false,false,{[2]={{t="I make my own, small ones",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"Don't say that word, don't get my hopes up, I can't take it!","Is there? Is there?! tell me, tell me quick!"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"No cure..."},false,false,{[1]={{t="and I wouldn't use it",afterMs=3500},{t="not now, not for her",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"If there's a cure, they're sitting on it, I'd bet my house on it","Cure?! The only cure is a gun to the right place"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"Maybe one day"},false,false,{[1]={{t="and when it comes, I'll share it with you",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"A cure? Ha! The cure's a bullet in the head and I got plenty of those","If there's a cure they ain't sharing it with the likes of us, they never do","Only cure I know of is not getting bit, and that's a lousy cure","Somebody told me they got a shot at the base, I told him to go get it and bring me one, he never came back","There's guys on the road selling bottles of \"cure\", I took the bottles and gave the guys a talking to","I don't want one, I'm doing better than I ever did, why would I want it fixed?","My brother got bit, I sat with him three hours, no cure came, so don't ask me about cures"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"You'd better pray there isn't, because I'd sell it to the highest bidder and you can't afford me","Cure for what, being stupid? That one's a bullet too"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"God, I wish... my kid sister got bit on day two, I keep thinking if I'd just found a doctor in time","They say the Army's working on something, but they say a lot of things, don't they?","Haven't heard of one, but if you do, come find me first, hear?"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Man, if there was a cure you think my people'd be dead?","There ain't no cure, it's a lie, only cure is you put it down before it gets up","Some dude told me about a hospital with a shot, I went, it was full of dead people","Prayer, they say, my grandma prays every night, I told her pray harder","I'd trade everything I own for a cure, but I ain't got nothing to trade it with"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Cure for what? Your attitude? That's a bullet"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I really hope so, I really do... my girl got scratched last night, I don't know what to do"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Rumor was the base had a vaccine, but I never met anybody who got one","Only treatment I know is whiskey, and it doesn't work on bites, believe me, I tested","Doc in our chapter says cut the limb off fast, if it's an arm, and pray, I've seen it work once","I'd give my bike for a cure, then again I'd give my bike for a lot of things"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Only cure you're getting from me is a fast one"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=club|st=friendly",{"I hope so, {g:brother|sister}, I really do... we lost two good men and I'd do anything to stop that"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"If there were a cure, those with access wouldn't be sharing it, I know how that works","It would cost more than anyone here has, I assure you","Everyone's selling hope this week, I'm not buying","I've been asked that by three different men, each offered me more than the last, I'd have taken any of it if I had one"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I hope it exists, for all our sakes, and I hope someone has the sense to share it"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Cure? There ain't no cure, just hope, and I used mine up in the first week","In lockup, a guy swore he knew a cure, told us to drink bleach, I'm not saying he's dead because of it, but he is","Nobody cures nothing in this world, I'd know, I asked the prison doctor for years about my teeth"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Stop asking stupid questions!","Cure?! You see any hospital around here? ANY?!"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"A cure would be a miracle and I haven't seen a miracle in years... but I'd love to"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Not that I've heard, and I've heard a lot","Only cure I trust is distance, put a mile between you and it","Heard there's a doctor in Elizabethtown with some pills, haven't verified, wouldn't bet my life on it","Folks pray over it, boil herbs, drink moonshine, the only thing I've seen work is a clean shot early"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Maybe someday, until then we make do and keep each other alive"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"They never told us anything, I doubt there is one, or I wouldn't be running"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"None has been announced, as far as I know","CDC said they were working on it, then we lost contact, so I just don't know anymore","Hospital tried antibiotics and isolation for a day or two, none of it worked","I've put down three of my own, so believe me, I'd love one to exist"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Don't spread rumors, it only makes people panic"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=law|st=friendly",{"I wish I could say yes, honestly, I do, but I haven't heard of one"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"If there is one the Army has it, and the Army isn't telling me a thing"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Research is ongoing, that's all I can say","There's no authorized treatment at this time","Every medic I've talked to says no, and they'd know"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Not discussing that, so drop it"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=military|st=friendly",{"I want to believe there is, I really do... I've seen things I can't unsee"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=soldier_nco|st=neutral,careful",{"Prevention is the only treatment, so keep your distance and watch your arms"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"They gave us a shot at induction, I thought maybe... but it's just the usual stuff, I think","I heard they had something at the base, a shot, but... I don't know if it works, I really don't"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=elite|st=neutral,careful",{"No comment on that"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"If there was a cure, somebody'd be selling it"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Prayer and quarantine, that's all we've got","Doc Hendricks says there's no cure, just isolation, and he's the only one with a diploma"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=militia|st=friendly",{"We keep hoping, friend, and that's something"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,7",{"They'll have something by next week, they have to - they made a polio shot, didn't they?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|hour=4,11",{"My girl's had a fever since this morning - if you hear about any medicine, anything at all, would you come find us?"},false,{[1]="HELP_THEM"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"If there was a cure, don't you think somebody would be driving it around with the sirens on?","I keep the peroxide close, I know it won't do anything - it makes me feel better, okay?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC",[2]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family|st=friendly,neutral|day=8,9999",{"I stopped waiting on a cure about the time I stopped waiting on the mail"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"There's no cure for a bite, there's a shovel, and there's a decision","Cure's the same as it was on day one - don't get bit"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Heard a fella in Riverside took his own arm off at the elbow - didn't take - don't let anybody sell you that one"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"No cure, and I'm done with questions, beat it"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=worker,civilian|st=friendly,neutral",{"Lady at the pharmacy in West Point handed out penicillin for free the first week - didn't save a soul, but she tried"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=rescue|role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"I pushed every antibiotic we had into the first ones - not one came down off the fever, there isn't a cure - I'm sorry"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=rescue|role=rescue_medical,rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Scrub a scratch hard and fast and pray it was shallow - that's about all we got left"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=rescue|role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"I pray for one every night, I also tell people not to wait on it"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"No, {sir}, whatever you heard at a roadblock or on a CB, it isn't true"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral|day=3,12",{"Last bulletin said the state health people were working on it - that was a good while back"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"If you're bit, you tell me now, from right where you're standing"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral|day=6,9999",{"Medics on the line had nothing, they quit carrying the kits by the end of the first week"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=elite",{"No countermeasure exists - plan accordingly"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=military,elite,swat|st=careful",{"Show me your forearms and your neck - slowly"},false,{[1]="SHOW_ARMS"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=outlaw,raider,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Cure? A bullet's a cure, fixes everything, permanent"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=crime,outlaw|st=friendly,neutral",{"Guy up in Valley Station was selling a cure out of his trunk - twenty bucks a bottle, it was grape drink and rubbing alcohol"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=gang,club,crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Somebody finds a cure, they're gonna charge for it, I plan on being the one charging"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"Only cure out here is staying out of our way"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"There's a cure for nosy - want me to show you?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=raider,prison,gang|st=careful,hostile",{"You look sick to me - walk away before somebody decides to fix it"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Somebody said there's a shot up in Louisville, somebody says a lot of things"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=family|st=neutral|mood=sad",{"I keep the radio on all night in case somebody says the word - nobody says it"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"You can't cure a bite by hoping, that's the nearest thing to medicine I know"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=rescue_medical|st=neutral|mood=grim",{"No, I've watched nine people go and not one turned back - that's my whole data"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"I won't tell you there's a cure, I'd sooner sit with you and be honest"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"First week everybody said cure, now nobody says it, that tells you something"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"No official word on a treatment, anybody selling one is robbing you slow"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Negative, and if there was, I'd not be standing at this crossroads talking to you"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=elite_delta|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"I've seen no evidence of one, I'd not build a plan on absence of evidence either"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=crime_member|st=neutral",{"There's a fella selling pills he swears by, he sells a lot of things he swears by"}},
{"ASK_CURE","role=family_elder|st=neutral|world=road",{"Polio took two off my road in '52, took 'em years to fix that, we ain't got years"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=raider,gang|tmp=predator|st=hostile|mood=funny",{"Cure? Sure - don't get bit, that'll be one can of anything, thank you kindly"}},
{"ASK_CURE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=hostile|mood=angry",{"Don't, don't put that in my head, I've got somebody in a back room - don't you dare"}},
}
